  // 8 and 9 trigger special behavior in APInt when mishandling signed versus
  // unsigned, so we pay extra attention to those.
  // CHECK:STDERR: numeric_literals.carbon:[[@LINE+7]]:29: error: member access into undefined facet type `Core.ImplicitAs(i32)` [QualifiedExprInUndefinedFacetTypeScope]
